<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Us | SNPN</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    
    <style>
        /* Specific styles for the About page to match the new aesthetic */
        .page-header {
            /* Changed to the deep purplish-navy to match the awards section */
            background-color: #0A2F5D; 
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 60px 10%;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: inset 0 -10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .page-header h1 {
            color: #ffffff; /* Explicitly forced white so it fixes the issue in image_957c02.png */
            font-size: 38px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        .page-header p {
            color: #CBD5E1; /* Soft slate for the subtitle, much more readable on dark backgrounds */
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .about-container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 60px auto;
            padding: 0 5%;
        }
        .about-card {
            background-color: var(--bg-white, #ffffff);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 50px;
            box-shadow: var(--card-shadow, 0 4px 20px -2px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08));
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle, #E2E8F0);
        }
        .about-card h2 {
            color: var(--primary-dark, #0F172A);
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            font-size: 28px;
            border-bottom: 3px solid var(--accent-brand, #2563EB);
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .about-text {
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: var(--text-gray, #475569);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .profile-section {
            display: flex;
            gap: 50px;
            align-items: center;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
        .profile-image {
            width: 250px;
            height: 250px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            object-fit: cover;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            border: 5px solid var(--bg-white, #ffffff);
        }
        .profile-info h3 {
            color: var(--text-dark, #0F172A);
            font-size: 26px;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        .profile-info h4 {
            color: var(--accent-brand, #2563EB);
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        
        /* Make it stack nicely on mobile phones */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .profile-section {
                flex-direction: column;
                text-align: center;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <div class="page-header">
        <h1>About SNPN</h1>
        <p>Advancing Neuropeptide & Neuroendocrine Research in India</p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-container">
        
        <div class="about-card">
            <h2>Our Mission & Vision</h2>
            <p class="about-text">The Society of Neuropeptides and Neuroendocrinology (SNPN) was established with a singular vision: to foster collaboration, ignite innovation, and support groundbreaking research in the fields of neuropeptides and neuroendocrinology across India and globally.</p>
            <p class="about-text">By providing a platform for both eminent scientists and emerging researchers, SNPN aims to facilitate the exchange of ideas, promote educational initiatives, and drive scientific inquiry that addresses crucial biological and medical challenges in neuroscience.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-card">
            <h2>Our Founding President</h2>
            <div class="profile-section">
                <img src="/images/founder.jpg" alt="Prof. Nishikant Subhedar" class="profile-image">
                
                <div class="profile-info">
                    <h3>Prof. Nishikant Subhedar</h3>
                    <h4>Founding President, SNPN</h4>
                    <p class="about-text">Prof. Nishikant Subhedar has been a pioneering force in the realm of neuroendocrinology. His lifelong dedication to advancing the field laid the fundamental groundwork for the creation of SNPN.</p>
                    <p class="about-text">Throughout his illustrious career, he has mentored countless students, led critical research projects, and championed the necessity of a dedicated society to unite researchers. His vision and leadership continue to inspire the society's current and future endeavors.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>